<view class="wrap center">
  <view class="seal-env"><view class="flap"></view><view class="wax">期</view></view>
  <block wx:if="{{state === 'loading'}}"><view class="muted">正在取信…</view></block>
  <block wx:elif="{{state === 'sealed'}}">
    <view class="display h">来自朋友的一封信</view>
    <view class="para muted-text">信已封缄。回答 16 个问题，就能拆开它，看看你们的契合度。</view>
    <view class="muted">你看不到对方是哪位嘉宾，对方也看不到你的。</view>
    <button class="btn btn-primary full" hover-class="btn-hover" bindtap="reply">开始回信</button>
  </block>
  <block wx:elif="{{state === 'self'}}">
    <view class="display h">这是你自己寄出的信</view>
    <view class="muted">把它转发给朋友，等他们回信吧。</view>
    <button class="btn btn-primary full" hover-class="btn-hover" bindtap="openHistory">看看谁回信了</button>
  </block>
  <block wx:elif="{{state === 'offline'}}">
    <view class="display h">信暂时取不出来</view>
    <view class="muted">邮局还没开张（服务暂未开通），这会儿算不了你们的契合度。你可以先自己测一测。</view>
    <button class="btn btn-primary full" hover-class="btn-hover" bindtap="goHome">自己测一测</button>
  </block>
  <block wx:else>
    <view class="display h">这封信找不到了</view>
    <view class="muted">链接可能已失效。你也可以自己测一测，再寄一封给朋友。</view>
    <button class="btn btn-primary full" hover-class="btn-hover" bindtap="goHome">自己测一测</button>
  </block>
</view>
